  <title>Boot From C-die E-Core</title> 
  <body> 
	 <p> To boot from a C-die E-core, all big cores in C-dies need to be disabled through CPU Soft Strap High Register. For more details, refer to the 
		<xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-8A9082BB-35CE-46E1-9260-F5408CD5658C.dita#GUID-8A9082BB-35CE-46E1-9260-F5408CD5658C/TABLE_5491A5F35A4449B88648B4314271B1CF"><?xm-replace_text SOFT_STRAP_HIGH Register?></xref>.
	 </p> 
